# Windows + GitHub

- The working copy is `C:\Users\carlo\OneDrive\Desktop\Projects\Ashenwake`.
- GitHub is the only remote: `https://github.com/carlostovar1995/ashenwake.git`.
- Open this folder in Cursor and Godot.
- End of a session: `git add`, commit, `git push origin`. On the laptop: `git pull` in a local clone of the same repo.
- The desktop shortcut **Sync Ashenwake** runs `scripts/windows/Sync-Ashenwake.ps1`.
- Windows `git` and `gh` talk to GitHub directly.
